# Derived by hand from Semantics ch. 9 as ruled (a supplier's computed answer, here go's click filtered by ?Remote, is an input of the next tick, which is owed: the pad's hit lands in the compute tick after each click), ch. 9's forwarding (the label re-emitted at 1/[1]/0) and R3.
test an_event_answers_a_child

tick 0
  added:
    0: Ui.Button(label="go")
    1/[1]/0: Ui.Label(text="0 hits")

tick 1
  in:
    0: click

tick 2
  changed:
    1/[1]/0: Ui.Label(text="1 hits")

tick 3
  in:
    0: click

tick 4
  changed:
    1/[1]/0: Ui.Label(text="2 hits")
